"t.about": "Eshan Barua, founder of AIPG (Adbhik Innovation & Product Group), Dhaka.\nA studio and a software house under one roof, for clients worldwide.\nAt Bonusly since December 2026; previously Xpert Fintech and Grameenphone.",
"t.aipg": "AIPG: films that sell, software that runs your business.\nStudios   brand ads, product films, jingles, sonic logos. From US$400; 30s ad in 72 hours\nSystems   websites from US$1,100; HRMS, VMS, store, DMS, HMS from US$2,900\nReach     AI sales agent for chat and phone\nRun with AIPG Brain: 74 AI agents, a human yes on everything.\nSite: aipgbd-nexus.vercel.app",
