"t.products": "E-HR           HR and payroll for Bangladesh\nSEROSA         hospital management, 29 modules\nVMS            procurement, PPR 2008 and VAT Act 2012\nStore          POS, stock and loyalty with an AI assistant\nDocForge       documents, e-signatures, Bangla OCR\nOmniLedger     accounting and multi-currency ledger\nSupport Desk   ticketing for software clients\nxpertfintech   company website with live DSE/CSE data\nAIPG Brain     74-agent AI back office\nAIPG Reach     AI sales agent across chat and phone\nScroll down to open the live demos.",
"t.research": "IEEE, 2021:\n1. Development of Web-Based System for Essential Services During the COVID-19 Pandemic (ICCIT)\n2. Bid & Buy: An Effective Online-Based Platform for Client and Vendor (ICCMC)",
"t.roles": "Now: at Bonusly since December 2026.\nAlso open to:\n1. AIPG projects (films, websites, business software)\n2. Contract work and advisory",
